// resources/app.rc - the icon both executables carry.
//
// The .ico is generated, never drawn by hand: `python tools/make-icon.py --art <png>` cuts the plate
// out of the supplied art and writes resources/Wallpaper.png (the 1024 master) plus Wallpaper.ico
// from it, and `--ico-from` rewrites the .ico from that master alone. So what Explorer shows, what
// the taskbar shows and what the two tray icons show all come from one asset.
// Resource id 1 is what Engine/App/Tray.cpp loads with MAKEINTRESOURCEW(1).
1 ICON "Wallpaper.ico"
